{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 1 från S.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 1 by S.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Direction of energy policy", "dok_titel": "Energy Policy", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions \n\n2025/26:625 by Jamal El-Haj (-) demand 1, \n\n2025/26:767 by Joakim Sandell et al. (S) demands 1 and 4, \n\n2025/26:1179 by Martina Johansson and Mikael Larsson (both C) demands 1-3, \n\n2025/26:1437 by Markus Selin et al. (S) demand 1, \n\n2025/26:1442 by Patrik Lundqvist et al. (S) demand 4, \n\n2025/26:1447 by Ida Karkiainen et al. (S) demand 7, \n\n2025/26:1481 by Hanna Westerén (S), \n\n2025/26:2797 by Nooshi Dadgostar et al. (V) demand 4, \n\n2025/26:3273 by Linus Lakso et al. (MP) demand 1, \n\n2025/26:3282 by Katarina Luhr et al. (MP) demand 7, \n\n2025/26:3405 by Emma Berginger et al. (MP) demand 36, \n\n2025/26:3422 by Katarina Luhr et al. (MP) demands 38 and 39, \n\n2025/26:3582 by Rickard Nordin et al. (C) demands 86, 92, 102, 131 and 132, \n\n2025/26:3594 by Fredrik Olovsson et al. (S) demands 3, 4 and 10, \n\n2025/26:3596 by Elisabeth Thand Ringqvist et al. (C) demand 16 and \n\n2025/26:3789 by Daniel Riazat (-) demand 5.", "notis": "The Riksdag said no to 197 proposals in motions on energy policy. The proposals were submitted during the general motion period in 2025.\nAmong other things, the proposals concern the direction of energy policy, nuclear power, wind power, biofuels and biofuels, energy efficiency, energy gases, and heat and combined heat and power.\nThe Riksdag refers, among other things, to the conducted policy and ongoing work.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions \n\n2025/26:625 by Jamal El-Haj (-) demand 1, \n\n2025/26:767 by Joakim Sandell et al. (S) demands 1 and 4, \n\n2025/26:1179 by Martina Johansson and Mikael Larsson (both C) demands 1-3, \n\n2025/26:1437 by Markus Selin et al. (S) demand 1, \n\n2025/26:1442 by Patrik Lundqvist et al. (S) demand 4, \n\n2025/26:1447 by Ida Karkiainen et al. (S) demand 7, \n\n2025/26:1481 by Hanna Westerén (S), \n\n2025/26:2797 by Nooshi Dadgostar et al. (V) demand 4, \n\n2025/26:3273 by Linus Lakso et al. (MP) demand 1, \n\n2025/26:3282 by Katarina Luhr et al. (MP) demand 7, \n\n2025/26:3405 by Emma Berginger et al. (MP) demand 36, \n\n2025/26:3422 by Katarina Luhr et al. (MP) demands 38 and 39, \n\n2025/26:3582 by Rickard Nordin et al. (C) demands 86, 92, 102, 131 and 132, \n\n2025/26:3594 by Fredrik Olovsson et al. (S) demands 3, 4 and 10, \n\n2025/26:3596 by Elisabeth Thand Ringqvist et al. (C) demand 16 and \n\n2025/26:3789 by Daniel Riazat (-) demand 5.", "Reservation 1"]}, "votering_id": "2B62FF90-71B5-407E-A77D-6EF86C0F16CB", "rm": "2025/26", "beteckning": "NU13", "punkt": 1, "dok_id": "HD01NU13", "datum": "2026-03-04", "utskott": "NU", "rubrik": "Energipolitikens inriktning", "dok_titel": "Energipolitik", "sammanfattning": "Näringsutskottet föreslår att riksdagen säger nej till 197 förslag i motioner om energipolitik. Förslagen lämnades in under den allmänna motionstiden 2025.\nBland annat handlar förslagen om energipolitikens inriktning, kärnkraft, vindkraft, biobränslen och biodrivmedel, energieffektivisering, energigaser samt värme och kraftvärme.\nUtskottet hänvisar bland annat till den förda politiken och pågående arbete.", "forslag_text": "Riksdagen avslår motionerna \n\n2025/26:625 av Jamal El-Haj (-) yrkande 1, \n\n2025/26:767 av Joakim Sandell m.fl. (S) yrkandena 1 och 4, \n\n2025/26:1179 av Martina Johansson och Mikael Larsson (båda C) yrkandena 1-3, \n\n2025/26:1437 av Markus Selin m.fl. (S) y